          },
          "400040811": {
            "id": "400040811",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Crafty",
            "text": "Well, the safety of Liyue is in your hands now. Good luck — even the Treasure Hoarders don't want to see the city burned to the ground.",
